{"id":"000VMT","title":"Line Dancing","author":"Dr Logic","solvedCount":1,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-20T22:21:36+00:00","posted":"Gestern, 21:58 Uhr","rules":"I would like to thank IkeManga for testing over on the CTC discord, along with a few others.\n\nLet me know what you thought of this puzzle in the comments!\n\nHappy solving!\n\nDr Logic\n\nRules:\n\n• Normal sudoku rules apply, place the digits 1-9 once each in every row, column and 3x3 box.\n\n• Parity Lines: Along a red line, digits alternate parity (odd/even)\n\n• Zipper lines: Lavender lines, digits equidistant to the centre sum to the same total. If the line is of odd length, the centre is marked.\n\n• Renban lines: Digits on a magenta renban line form a non-repeating set of consecutive digits, in any order.\n\n• German Whispers lines: Adjacent digits along a green German whispers line differ by at least 5.\n\n• Each line belongs to a group. These groups are denoted by smaller coloured lines within the larger lines. The groups are: 'white, black, blue, red'. Within a group, digits placed on these lines cannot repeat (e.g, there cannot be two 4s in red, etc)\n\n• Cells separated by a black dot are in a 1:2 ratio, cells separated by a white dot are consecutive. Not all dots are given.\n\nPlay 'Line Dancing'\n\nIf you liked this puzzle and want more from me, please enjoy this!\n\nPlay 'Spaghettification' (LMD)","solutionCode":"Row 5 followed by column 5 of the finished grid (18 digits)","tags":["Sudoku"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/zk9k93i91e","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/zk9k93i91e","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-20T22:21:36+00:00"}